<section class="op03-apxs-sequence" aria-labelledby="op03-apxs-heading">
  <div class="op03-apxs-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="mars-kicker">APXS PROCESS</p>
      <h4 id="op03-apxs-heading">A close-range spectrometer turns energy signals into element evidence.</h4>
    </div>
    <span class="op03-apxs-badge">APXS ≠ TELESCOPE</span>
  </div>

  <div class="op03-apxs-flow" role="img" aria-label="Curiosity's robotic arm places APXS near a Martian rock. X-rays and alpha particles interact with the sample, the instrument measures characteristic energy, and scientists use the pattern as evidence for which elements are present.">
    <div class="apxs-step">
      <span class="apxs-icon arm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><b></b></span>
      <strong>ROBOTIC ARM</strong>
      <small>positions APXS</small>
    </div>
    <span class="apxs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div class="apxs-step">
      <span class="apxs-icon sensor-icon" aria-hidden="true">APXS</span>
      <strong>NEAR THE ROCK</strong>
      <small>close-range measurement</small>
    </div>
    <span class="apxs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div class="apxs-step">
      <span class="apxs-icon energy-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      <strong>ENERGY INTERACTION</strong>
      <small>X-rays + alpha particles</small>
    </div>
    <span class="apxs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div class="apxs-step">
      <span class="apxs-icon signal-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      <strong>MEASURED SIGNAL</strong>
      <small>characteristic energies</small>
    </div>
    <span class="apxs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div class="apxs-step">
      <span class="apxs-icon element-icon" aria-hidden="true">Fe · S · Ca</span>
      <strong>ELEMENT EVIDENCE</strong>
      <small>composition clues</small>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="op03-apxs-rule"><strong>APXS is a close-range spectrometer.</strong> It measures a nearby sample; it is not an astronomical telescope looking across space.</p>

  <details class="op03-apxs-details">
    <summary>How does APXS work?</summary>
    <p>APXS sends X-rays and alpha particles toward a nearby rock or soil sample. The sample releases characteristic energy that the instrument measures, helping scientists identify which elements are present.</p>
  </details>
</section>
